const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"先看这份早期版本研究了谁",en:"Start with the early draft's actual assets"},body:{zh:"这份工作论文研究比特币、Ripple与以太坊，而不是今日所有代币。三条价格序列起点不同，分别始于2011、2013和2015年，均结束于2018年5月31日。不同长度会改变共同检验窗口，不能把三种资产的结果视为同一个完整市场面板。",en:"The draft studies Bitcoin, Ripple and Ethereum, not today's full token universe. Price histories begin in 2011, 2013 and 2015 respectively and end on May 31, 2018. Different lengths affect common testing windows, so the three series should not be treated as a balanced panel of the entire market."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w24877/w24877.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2018年8月工作论文，第2–4页",en:"Source: August 2018 working paper, pp. 2–4"}}},{title:{zh:"传统因子是比较基准，不是独立性证明",en:"Traditional factors are benchmarks, not proof of independence"},body:{zh:"作者比较股票因子、货币、贵金属与宏观变量的解释力，并指出许多传统解释在该样本中较弱。但文中仍有个别资产与因子的关联，不能把总体讨论翻译成“加密资产与一切传统市场无关”。统计上未检出稳定关系，也不等于关系永远不存在。",en:"Equity factors, currencies, precious metals and macro variables serve as comparison benchmarks. Many conventional explanations are weak in this sample, but asset-specific associations remain. Failure to detect a stable pattern does not establish permanent independence from every traditional market or economic variable."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w24877/w24877.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2018年8月工作论文，第2–3页",en:"Source: August 2018 working paper, pp. 2–3"}}},{title:{zh:"关注度和情绪方向是两回事",en:"Attention is different from emotional tone"},body:{zh:"Google搜索和包含Bitcoin的Twitter发帖数量被用作关注度代理，另有与黑客事件相关的搜索比率考察负面关注。搜索变多可能源于担忧或兴趣，所以不能直接解读为看多。关键词、分母、采样频率和时间对齐都会改变这个指标的含义。",en:"Google searches and Twitter post counts mentioning Bitcoin proxy for attention, while a hack-related search ratio examines negative attention. More searches can reflect concern or curiosity rather than optimism. Keywords, denominators, sampling frequency and time alignment are therefore part of the measure's meaning."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w24877/w24877.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2018年8月工作论文，第3–4页",en:"Source: August 2018 working paper, pp. 3–4"}}},{title:{zh:"钱包数量不是现金分红",en:"Wallet counts are not cash dividends"},body:{zh:"草稿用价格相对于钱包用户数量的比值构造带引号的“价格股息比”。这里的钱包用户数量只是采用程度的代理，不是资产向持有人支付的现金流。论文在这份版本中未发现该指标的预测力，也不能据此推导出所有网络采用指标都无效。",en:"The draft's quoted price-to-dividend proxy divides price by wallet-user counts. Those counts proxy for adoption rather than cash distributions to holders. The reported lack of predictive power for this construction does not establish that every network-adoption measure is uninformative."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w24877/w24877.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2018年8月工作论文，第3–4页",en:"Source: August 2018 working paper, pp. 3–4"}}},{title:{zh:"比较资产时还要比较数据窗口",en:"Comparisons inherit different data windows"},body:{zh:"加密价格来自CoinDesk，而股票、汇率、债券与其他比较序列来自不同资料库，其中一些更早结束。完整研究需要明确每项回归实际使用的交集窗口。某一个交易所的现货数据不能自动替代这些多来源序列，更不能补出没有观察到的历史。",en:"Crypto prices come from CoinDesk, whereas equities, currencies, bonds and other comparison series use different databases, some ending earlier. Each regression needs its actual overlapping window. A single venue's spot series cannot silently replace the multi-source inputs or create unobserved history."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w24877/w24877.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2018年8月工作论文，第4–5页",en:"Source: August 2018 working paper, pp. 4–5"}}},{title:{zh:"预测关联与交易结果之间仍有距离",en:"Predictive associations are not trading outcomes"},body:{zh:"草稿讨论动量与注意力变量对后续收益的历史预测关系。这样的统计关联与扣除交易成本后、经过样本外检验的投资表现是不同问题。把论文用于新数据时，需要重新处理观察时点、样本变化与估计不确定性，不能直接沿用早期样本的结论。",en:"The draft discusses historical return predictability from momentum and attention. Such associations are distinct from out-of-sample investment performance after trading costs. Applying the questions to new data requires renewed timing, sample and estimation checks rather than carrying the early findings forward as current trading results."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w24877/w24877.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2018年8月工作论文，第2–4页",en:"Source: August 2018 working paper, pp. 2–4"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读依据2018年工作论文，题录保留2021年期刊版。早期三种资产的结果不代表当前整个加密市场；历史注意力关联也不是可执行收益保证。",en:"This guide uses the 2018 working paper and retains the 2021 journal citation. Its early three-asset sample does not represent the entire current crypto market, and historical attention associations are not executable return guarantees."}};export{e as default};
